720	     *  does (see {@link Dues#parts}). Refused when the share is not above 0.00 (400), the claim is
721	     *  settled, void or deleted (409), the person is the claim's own person or already holds a share
722	     *  of it (409), or its shares would add up to more than 100.00 (422). */
723	    @Transactional
724	    public Claim share(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, long withPersonId, BigDecimal share) {
725	        if (share.signum() <= 0) {
